      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WINSOME JOSIE (2) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 1.75 lengths from the winner Fearless Bandit (29.90) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with five wins and a minor placing from eight starts. One of the leading chances. BEFORE THE DAWN (1) produced a modest effort most recently when seventh at Q Parklands over 600m behind Kingsbrae Brett (35.19) in a Grade 5/6. Was in the money the start prior. Can figure in the finish. BABY FACE BANDIT (4) hit the frame last time at this track but just a few starts ago ran blistering time when scoring over 520m at this track in 29.69. Rates a leading chance if runs up to recent winning time. BACK TOMORROW (6) cannot be ruled out.",
